    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What does Forage actually give you?</div><div class="faq-a">A certificate. It shows you completed a simulation. It does not show work quality, a score, or recruiter access.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What does Zero give you instead?</div><div class="faq-a">A receipt: scored work reviewed by a top-1% professional, visible to recruiters before they see your resume.</div></div>
