    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is Zero free too?</div><div class="faq-a">Yes. Zero is recruiter-paid. Forage is free for students but generates revenue elsewhere. Zero is paid by recruiters, so your work is valuable to them.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Which one helps you get hired faster?</div><div class="faq-a">Zero. A receipt is evaluated by recruiters before the interview. A certificate is not.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Can you use both platforms?</div><div class="faq-a">Yes, but prioritize zero for the roles you care about. Use Forage for exploration and zero for proof.</div></div>
  </section>

